WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.592 --> 00:00:08.928
A bob is the most common length among wedding parents, and it's a great starting point for an updo.

2
00:00:09.264 --> 00:00:18.120
If it's a longer bob that reaches the shoulders, you can create a full bun with your own hair, no hairpiece needed.

3
00:00:18.456 --> 00:00:26.592
But a shorter bob — about 3 to 5 cm below the ears — or a mid-length bob leaves just a small ponytail when pulled back, too short for a proper bun,

4
00:00:26.928 --> 00:00:31.536
so a partial hairpiece matching your hair color needs to be added.

5
00:00:31.872 --> 00:00:40.560
Too many layers make the hairpiece blend less naturally, so it's best to avoid cutting your hair and keep the length before the wedding.
